        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWBOR, Newport Rose With Bordeaux Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bordeaux Half Round Knob With Newport Rosette is a beautiful addition to classic homes. The crystal will add an old world romance to any room. The 24% lead content provides the perfect clarity necessary to make such a pure shape dazzle. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWFON Bordeaux Crystal Knob With Round Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Newport Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Bordeaux Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bordeaux French Crystal Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Bordeaux Knob Diameter: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Bordeaux Knob Projection: 2.10\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWBOR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262307\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur NEWBOR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bordeaux Half Round Knob With Newport Rosette, Grandeur NEWBOR",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWBOR Bordeaux Half Round Knob With Newport Rosette - The Bordeaux Half Round Knob With Newport Rosette is a beautiful addition to classic homes. The crystal will add an old world romance to any room. The 24 percent lead content provides the perfect clarity necessary to make such a pure shape dazzle. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Newport Rose With Bordeaux Knobs, Grandeur NEWBOR, GRA-NEWBOR, Bordeaux Half Round Knob With Newport Rosettes, glass knobs, crystal knobs, classic knobs, ornate knobs, victorian knobs, Grandeur Newport series, crystal Bordeaux Knob with Newport Rosettes, Bordeaux Knob with Newport Roses, rope roses, Grandeur french crystal collection,"
